OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fdry with variable cloud, allowing some
OL,7,Fgood spells of evening sunshine. The
OL,8,Fwinds will ease further, becoming
OL,9,Fgenerally light but remaining breezy
OL,10,Falong the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,13,Fthrough the morning, mostly clearing
OL,14,Fby mid-afternoon. Then dry with plenty
OL,15,Fof sunshine. Very warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
